<title>USA: Galaxy Enterprises buys Internet store.</title>
<headline>Galaxy Enterprises buys Internet store.</headline>
<dateline>PROVO, Utah 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Galaxy Enterprises Inc said it has acquired Books Now Inc, an Internet-based bookstore.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The company said that Books Now President and Chief Executive David Chazin has agreed to a three-year employment contract.</p>
<p>Galaxy also owns and operates Access Galaxy Mall, an electronic shopping site on the World Wide Web.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
